{{also|wurst}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|wurst|lang=goh}}. Possibly related to the verb {{term|wirren}} (from {{proto|Indo-European|wers-|lang=de}}), which would point to an original meaning of "mixture".

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/vʊʀst/|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|g=f|genitive=Wurst|plural=Würste}}

# [[sausage]]

===Adverb===
'''wurst'''

# [[anyway]], [[anyhow]]
#: ''Das ist mir '''wurst'''.'' - I don't care about it.

